                        "entry_id": "4687922e-dba1-3644-a5d9-6f42e1894df9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Zeitalter, das durch Informationstechnologien geprägt ist"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "45ac7926-f18e-4805-916d-c2b4b6b591ba",
                                "sense_id": "a7cf509d-a216-3c60-a759-180f6d2648eb",
                                "text": "„Das Merzlied könnte sich als eine allein dem Informationszeitalter angemessene Seuche erweisen.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f714c10b-fa21-4ed4-924b-61516c4c8a0f",
                        "source_entry_id": "4687922e-dba1-3644-a5d9-6f42e1894df9",
                        "source_sense_id": "a7cf509d-a216-3c60-a759-180f6d2648eb",
                        "source_sense_description": "Zeitalter, das durch Informationstechnologien geprägt ist",
                        "target_lang_word": "Information Age",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Information Age",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d350aa54-ec5c-3d05-80ac-a7d7dc513cab",
                                        "entry_id": "f0cc47b4-d0cf-366f-a989-8786fbb20ffa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The current era, characterised by the increasing importance and availability of information (especially by means of computers), as opposed to previous eras (such as the Industrial Age) in which most endeavours related to some physical process or product."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de1f61c5-e44a-47ed-949b-5d2d7f47a110",
                                                "sense_id": "d350aa54-ec5c-3d05-80ac-a7d7dc513cab",
                                                "text": "Just as we were beginning to feel comfortable about living in the space age, bold headlines in an I.B.M. advertisement told us “there's growing agreement that” we now are in the information age."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b2c17ab-4809-4d82-8ea0-9980ec918797",
                                                "sense_id": "d350aa54-ec5c-3d05-80ac-a7d7dc513cab",
                                                "text": "This is the information age, in which, we are told, biology is defined by a three-billion-letter instruction manual called the genome and human thoughts are analogous to digital bits flowing through a computer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c78279b-0cc5-49d3-8467-ce0f99618142",
                                                "sense_id": "d350aa54-ec5c-3d05-80ac-a7d7dc513cab",
                                                "text": "The resources of the information age enormously increase the potential productivity of such investigations. This situation will improve as more and more data becomes available."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
